Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "WildlifeEncounterOnRoad" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Gorilla moving across the road" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Collision risk with large animal moving into vehicle path" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential collision with an unpredictable living actor (gorilla) crossing the roadway at night.
Severity Score: 0.90